      "label": "knowledge-graph-data-store",
      "title": "The Knowledge Graph Data Store's contract",
      "description": "The contract a Knowledge Graph Data Store keeps: serve a declaration, its graph and its instructions exactly as committed, say plainly when a file is absent, and keep a new instance's declaration once it is written. A mechanical Actor plays this Role; this is what it must do, and what it can be tested against.",
